	(text "CAN bus: classical CAN 2.0B (ESP32-S3 TWAI), up to 1 Mbit/s.\nConnector pinout follows DroneCAN / Pixhawk JST-GH: 1 = +5 V, 2 = CANH, 3 = CANL, 4 = GND.\nBus supply must be 5 V nominal (LM66100 ORing on the Power sheet is rated 5.5 V max).\nClose JP1 (120 ohm termination) only on the two end nodes of the bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 76.2 124.46 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca66abb4-f927-4deb-96b0-4dee28915f6e"))
